---

# Folder Structure

Follow scalable architecture.

Use App Router.

Separate:

components

sections

features

hooks

lib

utils

services

constants

types

animations

providers

contexts

styles

assets

Never place everything in one folder.

---

# Coding Standards

Use TypeScript everywhere.

Never use "any".

Use reusable components.

Keep components small.

Prefer composition.

Follow SOLID principles.

Write clean code.

No duplicated logic.

Create reusable hooks.

Create reusable utility functions.

---

# Responsive Design

Support:

Mobile

Tablet

Laptop

Desktop

Large Desktop

Use Tailwind responsive breakpoints.

Never break layouts.

