# Hero Section

The hero section must be visually stunning.

Requirements

Large seafood video background.

Overlay gradient.

Clear CTA.

Search bar.

Category shortcuts.

Smooth GSAP entrance animations.

Three.js floating water particles.

Fish swimming animation.

Subtle ocean movement.

Call To Action

