---

# Three.js Requirements

Use Three.js carefully.

Possible scenes

Swimming Fish

Floating Water Particles

Ocean Waves

Bubble Effects

Light Rays

Never reduce website performance.

Keep animations lightweight.

---

# GSAP Usage

Use GSAP for

Page transitions

Scroll animations

Text reveal

Parallax

Image reveal

Horizontal scrolling

Pinned sections

Never animate everything.

Animations should enhance UX.

---

