---

# Development Rules

Never hardcode repeated values.

Use constants.

Use reusable hooks.

Separate UI and business logic.

Keep animations isolated.

Maintain naming consistency.

Avoid unnecessary dependencies.

Follow Next.js best practices.

Optimize for SEO and performance first.

Write production-ready code only.

---

# Final Objective

The final website should feel like a premium seafood brand rather than a simple online fish shop.

Every page should be elegant, fast, SEO-friendly, highly animated where appropriate, fully responsive, accessible, and easy to extend with backend integration in the future.
